1
00:00:00,918 --> 00:00:03,868
(Raj:)You didn't ask her out,
but that was a lot of sounds.

2
00:00:05,556 --> 00:00:07,156
(Leonard:)You guys are making me nervous.

3
00:00:07,258 --> 00:00:08,738
(Howard:)Fine, then go talk to her
on your own.

4
00:00:09,727 --> 00:00:10,727
(Sheldon:)I will.

5
00:00:18,102 --> 00:00:20,272
(Leonard:)-Excuse me.
-Yeah?

6
00:00:20,571 --> 00:00:23,551
Hi... I'm Leonard?

7
00:00:23,774 --> 00:00:26,114
(Penny:)Really? You don't sound so sure.

8
00:00:27,278 --> 00:00:28,948
(Leonard:)No, I am he.

9
00:00:32,116 --> 00:00:33,616
(Leonard:)Anyway...

10
00:00:33,918 --> 00:00:38,298
(Leonard:)There's been something I've wanted
to ask you for a long time.

11
00:00:38,422 --> 00:00:39,462
(Penny:)What's that?

12
00:00:39,590 --> 00:00:42,370
(Leonard:)I was wondering,
if you're not too busy...

13
00:00:44,095 --> 00:00:46,765
(Leonard:)...if you'd be interested in...

14
00:00:47,565 --> 00:00:50,405
(Leonard:)...telling me where the restroom is?

15
00:00:54,605 --> 00:00:56,105
(Penny:)I think you're too late.

16
00:00:56,240 --> 00:01:00,020
(Leonard:)Come on, I would not
have peed my pants.

